{"uid":"300291b1925fe35a","name":"test_a_cure_diff_that_touches_the_cited_path_leaves_the_record_pending","fullName":"tests.test_cure_invalidates#test_a_cure_diff_that_touches_the_cited_path_leaves_the_record_pending","historyId":"43e6d28a5db01c986a4c0163070e42ae","time":{"start":1791925517493,"stop":1791925517889,"duration":396},"description":"Cure-01-06 (PRD B rulings 3/4 and B.4, task 008, F06) rewrites this\n    node IN PLACE (zero fast-tier headroom -- one collected item, same as\n    before this task) to loop over an ASCII cited path (this test's own\n    original subject) and a Unicode one git's own `--name-only`\n    display-quotes (`\"docs/r\\303\\251sultats.md\"` for\n    `docs/résultats.md`) instead of adding a sibling test. Before this\n    task `_workspace_diff_paths` read that quoted rendering, which never\n    appears as a substring of the record's own unquoted `successCriteria`\n    text, so a cure that actually committed the cited Unicode path still\n    looked \"untouched\" here and un-reopened the record over evidence that\n    had in fact moved; the fix reads `-z`, NUL-delimited output instead, so\n    the reported path matches the criteria's own text again and both\n    iterations land on the same `pending` outcome.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Cure-01-06 (PRD B rulings 3/4 and B.4, task 008, F06) rewrites this<br />\nnode IN PLACE (zero fast-tier headroom -- one collected item, same as<br />\nbefore this task) to loop over an ASCII cited path (this test's own<br />\noriginal subject) and a Unicode one git's own <code>--name-only</code><br />\ndisplay-quotes (<code>&quot;docs/r\\303\\251sultats.md&quot;</code> for<br />\n<code>docs/résultats.md</code>) instead of adding a sibling test. Before this<br />\ntask <code>_workspace_diff_paths</code> read that quoted rendering, which never<br />\nappears as a substring of the record's own unquoted <code>successCriteria</code><br />\ntext, so a cure that actually committed the cited Unicode path still<br />\nlooked &quot;untouched&quot; here and un-reopened the record over evidence that<br />\nhad in fact moved; the fix reads <code>-z</code>, NUL-delimited output instead, so<br />\nthe reported path matches the criteria's own text again and both<br />\niterations land on the same <code>pending</code> outcome.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791925216481,"stop":1791925216481,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791925216482,"stop":1791925216482,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791925517406,"stop":1791925517406,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791925517407,"stop":1791925517423,"duration":16},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791925517424,"stop":1791925517460,"duration":36},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791925517424,"stop":1791925517424,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":fa